msgstr ""

msgid "The value of the `quarkus-dev-service-infinispan` label attached to the started container. This property is used when `shared` is set to `true`. In this case, before starting a container, Dev Services for Infinispan looks for a container with the `quarkus-dev-service-infinispan` label set to the configured value. If found, it will use this container instead of starting a new one. Otherwise, it starts a new container with the `quarkus-dev-service-infinispan` label set to the specified value."
msgstr ""

msgid "This property is used when you need multiple shared Infinispan servers."
msgstr ""

